WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.588
Twenty-three classic

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.519
graphics demos

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:03.262
back in your

00:00:03.074 --> 00:00:03.758
browser

00:00:04.278 --> 00:00:05.480
The gallery revives

00:00:05.292 --> 00:00:06.907
23 graphics card

00:00:06.719 --> 00:00:08.546
demos by 3dfx

00:00:08.629 --> 00:00:10.244
Nvidia and ATI

00:00:10.068 --> 00:00:12.980
from 1998 to 2006

00:00:13.111 --> 00:00:13.888
all running in

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.466
the browser

00:00:14.998 --> 00:00:15.634
There is a

00:00:15.446 --> 00:00:16.507
sea monster with

00:00:16.319 --> 00:00:17.745
500 fish that

00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:18.217
avoid it

00:00:18.489 --> 00:00:19.479
a werewolf with

00:00:19.444 --> 00:00:20.222
eight layers of

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:20.929
fur and a

00:00:20.741 --> 00:00:21.849
meadow of ten

00:00:21.661 --> 00:00:23.123
thousand grass blades

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:24.762
Smoke and water

00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:25.658
are simulated on

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.484
the card itself

00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:27.144
and you can

00:00:26.956 --> 00:00:27.757
poke a bubble

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.618
of springs or

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.727
pilot a mechanical

00:00:29.538 --> 00:00:30.163
squid

00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:31.716
Full story on

00:00:31.527 --> 00:00:32.423
the dashboard
